data: {"id": "c8467bf966d74bc1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1517", "run_id": "c8467bf966d74bc1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期 (Metrics + Describe)\n- **phase**: `Pending` (kube_pod_status_phase=1 for phase=Pending, phase=Running=0)。\n- **waiting_reason**: `ContainerCreating` (kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1, reason=\"ContainerCreating\")。\n- **restarts**: 0 — 容器从未启动过，无重试。\n- **Node**: node2/10.2.0.50；调度条件 PodScheduled=True，说明调度阶段没问题，卡在下层卷挂载。\n\n### 2. Events (kubectl_describe)\n- **第一次 Event** (7m25s ago, 累计 x55 over 103m):\n  > `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavai", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789051198989, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c8467bf966d74bc1-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "c8467bf966d74bc1", "seq": 1518, "ts_ms": 1789051205662, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 39.595, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c8467bf966d74bc1-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "e78666de6e285c5a9c0c1d90790879de60b5dae6bdd37306f6df4474d394c22a", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "f6a984e7029b0de5dde5095b8451536687e9d4d129a086e3a98f77d4371436cb"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "c8467bf966d74bc1-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "c8467bf966d74bc1", "seq": 1519, "ts_ms": 1789051205663, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c8467bf966d74bc1-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "c8467bf966d74bc1", "seq": 1520, "ts_ms": 1789051213431, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.768, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1526, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` phase: `Pending` | 确认故障处于集群调度/启动阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接锁定根本原因为配置缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`：`timed out waiting for the condition`（持续 103m） | 说明挂载阻塞已持续较长时间，非瞬时抖动 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 资源配置：CPU Request `5m` / Limit `50m`；Memory Request `8Mi` / Limit `32Mi` | 排除资源规格不足导致调度的可能性 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1，reason=`ContainerCreating` | 指标状态与 Kubernetes 事件记录的挂载失败原因相互印证 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 排除容器因启动失败引发频繁重启的可能 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#2）提供了决定性的错误信息，即挂载卷 `input` 失败，原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap。这一事实由 Metrics 指标（#5）中记录的 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态直接印证，且由于重启数为 0（#6），故障点固定在容器启动前的挂载准备阶段，未涉及运行时的应用逻辑。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用缺失 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器未进入 Running\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod 的 Spec 配置中引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该资源在集群中不存在，导致 `kubelet` 在执行卷挂载准备时失败。这解释了为何 Pod 长期处于 `Pending/ContainerCreating` 状态且无重启记录。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` phase: `Pending` | 确认故障处于集群调度/启动阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接锁定根本原因为配置缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`：`timed out waiting for the condition`（持续 103m） | 说明挂载阻塞已持续较长时间，非瞬时抖动 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 资源配置：CPU Request `5m` / Limit `50m`；Memory Request `8Mi` / Limit `32Mi` | 排除资源规格不足导致调度的可能性 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1，reason=`ContainerCreating` | 指标状态与 Kubernetes 事件记录的挂载失败原因相互印证 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0 | 排除容器因启动失败引发频繁重启的可能 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#2）提供了决定性的错误信息，即挂载卷 `input` 失败，原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap。这一事实由 Metrics 指标（#5）中记录的 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态直接印证，且由于重启数为 0（#6），故障点固定在容器启动前的挂载准备阶段，未涉及运行时的应用逻辑。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用缺失 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态 → 容器未进入 Running\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod 的 Spec 配置中引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该资源在集群中不存在，导致 `kubelet` 在执行卷挂载准备时失败。这解释了为何 Pod 长期处于 `Pending/ContainerCreating` 状态且无重启记录。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

